    {
      "label": "Local Government (Boundaries) Act (Northern Ireland) 2008 (2008 c. 7)",
      "url": "https://www.legislation.gov.uk/nia/2008/7",
      "note": "Royal Assent 23 May 2008. Section 1 divides Northern Ireland into 11 local government districts, each incorporating the whole or major part of the former districts it names, divided into wards on the recommendations of a Local Government Boundaries Commissioner. Section 1 came into operation for the Commissioner's review one week after Royal Assent, and for all other purposes on 1 Apr 2015 (S.R. 2013 No. 238); the Act also repealed the Local Government (Boundaries) Act (Northern Ireland) 1971."
    },
    {
      "label": "Local Government (Boundaries) Order (Northern Ireland) 2012 (S.R. 2012 No. 421)",
      "url": "https://www.legislation.gov.uk/nisr/2012/421",
      "note": "Made 30 Nov 2012 under section 50(10) of the Local Government Act (Northern Ireland) 1972, giving effect with modifications to the Local Government Boundaries Commissioner's recommendations: Schedule 1 names the 11 districts, each the area edged red on the deposited maps. In operation 1 Dec 2012 for election proceedings and otherwise from the first local election held after it was made (22 May 2014); not for rates for any year beginning before 1 Apr 2015, when the new districts took over."
    },
    {
      "label": "Local Government (Boundaries) (2008 Act) (Commencement, Transitional Provision and Savings) Order (Northern Ireland) 2013 (S.R. 2013 No. 238)",
      "url": "https://www.legislation.gov.uk/nisr/2013/238",
      "note": "Made 3 Oct 2013. Brought sections 1 (the 11 districts) and 3 of the Local Government (Boundaries) Act (Northern Ireland) 2008 into operation for the 2014 local elections and the new councils' first rates and budgets, and for all other purposes on 1 Apr 2015, when these districts replaced the 26 of 1973-2015."
    },
    {
      "label": "Local Government (Boundaries) (2008 Act) (Commencement, Transitional Provision and Savings) (Amendment) Order (Northern Ireland) 2015 (S.R. 2015 No. 210)",
      "url": "https://www.legislation.gov.uk/nisr/2015/210",
      "note": "Made and in operation 31 Mar 2015, the day before the 11 districts took over: kept the operational areas of the five Health and Social Care Trusts, defined by reference to the old districts, unchanged by the 1 Apr 2015 commencement."
    }
